\bibitem{re-solving-values}
When the previous solution is an approximation, rather than an exact Nash
  equilibrium, sound re-solving needs the expected values from a best-response
  to the player's previous strategy. In practice, though, using expected values
  from the previous solution in self-play often works as well or better than
  best-response values~\cite{SOM}.

